WEBVTT

00:17.060 --> 00:21.100
(Prince Xin's Manor)

00:45.260 --> 00:49.900
(Memorial Tablet of the Late Lady Gu)

01:06.140 --> 01:08.580
(Memorial Tablet of the Late Lady Gu)

01:21.430 --> 01:22.710
Your Highness, my condolences.

01:22.816 --> 01:24.576
On the anniversary
of my late wife's death,

01:24.640 --> 01:27.024
you accepted my invitation
to pay respects with me.

01:28.150 --> 01:29.400
I am immensely grateful.

01:31.150 --> 01:32.480
When I was far away in northwest,

01:33.200 --> 01:34.230
Qingzhi

01:34.510 --> 01:36.430
was my only dear friend
in the imperial capital.

01:36.840 --> 01:38.200
Of course, I wouldn't refuse.

01:38.224 --> 01:39.840
Now that I've paid my respects
to Qingzhi

01:40.040 --> 01:41.150
and fulfilled my wish,

01:41.232 --> 01:42.400
I should be heading back.

01:42.688 --> 01:44.920
Would you perhaps join me
in the study for some tea?

01:45.712 --> 01:47.280
Even just to keep Qingzhi company,

01:48.000 --> 01:49.230
please stay a little longer.

01:50.120 --> 01:50.760
Won't you?

03:15.540 --> 03:16.280
=Blossoms of Power=

03:16.290 --> 03:19.140
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:19.220 --> 03:22.180
=Episode 18=

03:32.680 --> 03:33.870
(Hexiang Grass?)

03:39.190 --> 03:40.750
(Mixing Hexiang Grass with tea leaves)

03:41.800 --> 03:43.000
(can enhance the aroma.)

03:44.150 --> 03:45.470
(But for Xiao Changqing,)

03:45.870 --> 03:46.910
(once he drinks it,)

03:47.504 --> 03:49.430
(he will suffocate and die
within moments.)

03:53.960 --> 03:54.520
Your Highness,

03:55.400 --> 03:55.960
please.

04:17.270 --> 04:18.750
Thank you for the tea, Your Highness.

04:19.040 --> 04:21.936
I just remembered I have urgent matters
to attend to at my residence.

04:22.032 --> 04:22.800
I'll take my leave.

04:37.440 --> 04:39.480
Your Highness,
the road is slippery from the snow.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.750
Let me help you walk slowly.

04:40.750 --> 04:42.240
Your Highness, what happened?

04:42.240 --> 04:43.360
Why are you in such a hurry?

05:41.830 --> 05:42.360
Quickly!

05:47.120 --> 05:48.040
No one

05:49.310 --> 05:50.510
knows about this matter.

05:52.830 --> 05:54.160
Except for Qingzhi.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.120
How did you know

05:57.120 --> 05:58.360
the antidote is here?

05:59.000 --> 06:00.040
Save your life first.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.040
I won't take it.

06:04.240 --> 06:06.120
Not unless you tell me

06:07.600 --> 06:09.120
that you are Qingzhi.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.630
If you save me,

06:49.750 --> 06:50.920
that's an admission.

06:51.310 --> 06:52.480
You're being unreasonable.

07:08.040 --> 07:09.390
Do you still remember this?

07:18.360 --> 07:21.000
This is the jade waist pendant
you used to love.

07:27.504 --> 07:29.750
Before, you were determined
to marry the Crown Prince.

07:32.000 --> 07:33.950
It was because he was
of the legitimate line,

07:34.920 --> 07:36.190
yet frail and sickly.

07:37.390 --> 07:39.190
You believed marrying such a husband

07:39.200 --> 07:41.270
would allow you to use his influence
to pave the way

07:41.280 --> 07:42.400
to protect the Shen family

07:42.510 --> 07:43.750
and to protect yourself

07:44.160 --> 07:46.310
because you had suffered
the excruciating pain

07:47.120 --> 07:48.630
of being powerless
over your own fate.

07:51.150 --> 07:52.912
Now, you've seen
through the Crown Prince's

07:52.928 --> 07:54.270
manipulative nature.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.360
Against him,

07:59.360 --> 08:00.680
no one stands a chance.

08:02.512 --> 08:04.480
That's why you want
to postpone the wedding.

08:05.270 --> 08:06.920
You want to refuse this marriage.

08:16.224 --> 08:18.016
I don't know what you're talking about.

08:18.430 --> 08:19.800
Every single word I say,

08:20.560 --> 08:22.000
you know exactly what it means.

08:24.560 --> 08:25.870
You are Gu Qingzhi.

08:31.630 --> 08:32.270
Aren't you?

08:39.670 --> 08:41.150
When Qingzhi was alive,

08:43.030 --> 08:44.840
you were truly sincere towards her.

08:46.390 --> 08:48.200
But you always imposed
your kindness on her

08:48.200 --> 08:49.360
in ways you thought were best.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.320
You thought
that if you climbed high enough,

08:52.790 --> 08:54.910
you could shelter her under your wing.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.550
That is why you climb up desperately,

08:58.910 --> 09:01.630
and you will clear every single
obstacle you face away one by one.

09:02.016 --> 09:03.360
And that includes the Gu family.

09:05.080 --> 09:06.910
The reason after the Gu family's fall

09:07.630 --> 09:09.510
that I chose to break ties
with them was...

09:09.510 --> 09:10.750
To save Gu Qingzhi's life.

09:13.440 --> 09:15.440
The fall of the Gu family
was not your fault.

09:16.320 --> 09:18.960
But you were supervising
their execution to save Gu Qingzhi.

09:19.270 --> 09:20.360
Was that what she wanted?

09:22.320 --> 09:23.390
What she wanted

09:24.440 --> 09:27.320
was to face any hardship together.

09:32.960 --> 09:33.960
I was wrong.

09:37.024 --> 09:38.790
I've known for a long time
that I was wrong.

09:39.910 --> 09:41.200
Give me one more chance.

09:43.480 --> 09:44.200
This time,

09:46.840 --> 09:48.080
I will fight with my life

09:49.000 --> 09:50.080
to keep you safe.

10:01.270 --> 10:03.030
Qingzhi once said in her letters

10:05.600 --> 10:06.320
that she

10:06.640 --> 10:07.840
never had feelings for you.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.200
Your marriage to her

10:11.120 --> 10:12.720
was just a marriage of convenience.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.120
But she also said

10:17.750 --> 10:18.720
that even so,

10:20.192 --> 10:22.440
you're the kind of person
who would do anything for her.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.790
So no matter what happened,

10:26.200 --> 10:27.840
she wanted you to live a peaceful life.

11:07.580 --> 11:09.100
(Vibrant and Dazzling)

11:14.360 --> 11:15.390
Xihe.

11:18.960 --> 11:20.016
There are some pastries.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.270
Wash your hands.

11:31.320 --> 11:32.150
What is this?

11:32.720 --> 11:35.000
This is a popular hand balm.

11:42.550 --> 11:43.550
It smells so good.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.510
Did you make this?

12:06.960 --> 12:08.150
It's so beautiful.

12:09.360 --> 12:11.270
Xihe, your needlework is incredible.

12:12.750 --> 12:14.000
What kind of fabric is this?

12:14.000 --> 12:15.030
It feels so smooth.

12:18.790 --> 12:19.600
Xihe,

12:21.000 --> 12:22.240
can you give it to me?

12:22.440 --> 12:23.200
No.

12:24.240 --> 12:25.480
If I gave it to you,

12:25.600 --> 12:27.664
you'd definitely be tempted
to wear it in secret.

12:27.910 --> 12:29.150
Any slip-up

12:29.168 --> 12:31.264
would be a fatal crime
of deceiving the emperor.

12:42.320 --> 12:44.510
Do you have plans
for Chinese New Year's Eve?

12:46.592 --> 12:49.240
Do you want to come to
my maternal grandparents' house with me?

12:49.790 --> 12:50.390
Really?

12:52.550 --> 12:55.030
Xihe, you're the best.

12:58.140 --> 13:02.660
(Pleasant Spring, Great Fortune)

13:05.750 --> 13:06.550
Be careful.

13:11.136 --> 13:12.710
(Tao Residence)
Here, this is for you.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.390
Hold it tight.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.480
For you.

13:14.480 --> 13:15.488
Thank you, Grandfather.

13:15.504 --> 13:15.870
Good.

13:17.480 --> 13:18.360
Xihe.

13:20.790 --> 13:21.870
Greetings, Director Tao.

13:22.270 --> 13:22.960
Grandfather.

13:23.200 --> 13:24.390
Uncle, Aunt.

13:24.432 --> 13:25.740
Happy Chinese New Year, everyone.

13:25.750 --> 13:27.440
- We're all well.
- Happy Chinese New Year.

13:27.450 --> 13:28.320
Happy Chinese New Year.

13:28.336 --> 13:29.152
Young Master Bu.

13:29.720 --> 13:32.630
You're celebrating the Chinese New Year
with us too?

13:32.656 --> 13:34.870
I have no family or relatives
in the imperial capital.

13:34.870 --> 13:36.750
The holidays are quite lonely for me.

13:37.120 --> 13:39.320
I hope I'm not imposing
on your household today.

13:39.910 --> 13:41.200
The more, the merrier.

13:41.200 --> 13:43.320
You are more than welcome.

13:43.600 --> 13:44.360
Exactly.

13:44.360 --> 13:45.240
Welcome.

13:45.240 --> 13:48.000
This is Chinese New Year's money
from your elders.

13:49.270 --> 13:52.150
May you have another year
of life and increased fortune.

13:52.240 --> 13:53.320
May you all be well.

13:53.320 --> 13:54.270
Thank you, Grandfather.

13:55.480 --> 13:56.120
Minister Tao,

13:56.440 --> 13:58.600
I won't take your money
for nothing.

13:58.608 --> 13:59.910
In a few days, I'll find a chance

13:59.952 --> 14:01.540
to give the Wang Residence a hard time.

14:01.552 --> 14:03.870
Why give the Wang Residence a hard time?

14:03.904 --> 14:06.030
Wang Zheng is unhappy about your
promotion to Director of Secretariat.

14:06.030 --> 14:07.320
He's been secretly causing trouble
for you.

14:07.320 --> 14:08.240
I'm well aware of that.

14:08.360 --> 14:09.360
I'll just annoy him a bit

14:09.480 --> 14:10.630
to vent your anger for you.

14:10.870 --> 14:12.030
Oh, you.

14:12.030 --> 14:15.790
Every month, you're accused
of dozens of offenses.

14:16.390 --> 14:18.550
You're at the top
of the Censorate's list.

14:18.630 --> 14:20.120
And you still dare to cause trouble?

14:20.440 --> 14:22.840
You are another year older now.

14:23.000 --> 14:25.030
It's time to act more appropriately.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.000
I have learned my lesson.

14:30.360 --> 14:32.510
Alright, let's go inside.

14:32.510 --> 14:34.448
- Let's go in.
- The Crown Prince has arrived!

14:35.616 --> 14:37.840
- Why is Crown Prince here?
- Why is Crown Prince here?

14:41.270 --> 14:43.360
Greetings, Your Highness.

14:43.792 --> 14:45.880
Minister Tao, please,
dispense with the formalities.

14:47.910 --> 14:48.630
Your Highness,

14:49.120 --> 14:51.320
you should be in the palace today.

14:51.870 --> 14:53.960
Why have you come to my residence?

14:54.000 --> 14:55.890
Chinese New Year's Eve
and Chinese New Year's Day

14:55.900 --> 14:57.056
should be spent with family.

14:57.360 --> 14:58.600
The palace has too many rules.

14:58.600 --> 14:59.900
Everything is rigid and formal.

14:59.910 --> 15:01.080
I find it cold and impersonal.

15:01.480 --> 15:04.320
Besides, I couldn't stop thinking
about the Commandery Princess.

15:04.750 --> 15:05.550
I came uninvited.

15:06.000 --> 15:07.080
I hope you don't mind.

15:08.200 --> 15:10.030
We are deeply honored by your presence

15:10.320 --> 15:12.790
in our humble home. It is a great honor.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.720
Then please, come inside.

15:15.960 --> 15:17.440
Happy Chinese New Year, Cousin-in-law.

15:17.910 --> 15:18.600
Uh...

15:19.030 --> 15:20.240
A child's words mean no harm.

15:20.240 --> 15:23.360
- A child's words mean no harm.
- Forgive him, Your Highness.

15:29.168 --> 15:30.360
Out of the mouths of babes.

15:30.790 --> 15:31.480
Say it again.

15:31.568 --> 15:33.120
Happy Chinese New Year, Cousin-in-law.

15:33.312 --> 15:33.960
Take them all.

15:34.608 --> 15:36.550
No, this is...
This is too much, Your Highness.

15:36.910 --> 15:37.240
Well...

15:37.240 --> 15:38.030
Please, come inside.

15:38.030 --> 15:39.390
- Come inside.
- Please, come in.

15:39.390 --> 15:40.736
- Let's take our seats.
- Come inside.

15:40.910 --> 15:41.320
Quick.

15:41.320 --> 15:42.390
Come on.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.150
Please come in.

15:43.150 --> 15:45.550
- Time for Chinese New Year's dinner!
- That's right!

15:45.550 --> 15:46.630
In another hour,

15:46.960 --> 15:48.976
it will be the first day
of the Chinese New Year.

15:49.000 --> 15:51.740
I want to bid farewell to the old year
and welcome the new one with you.

15:51.750 --> 15:53.000
And if I say I don't want to?

15:53.720 --> 15:55.120
Will you back down?

15:55.840 --> 15:56.910
When it comes to you,

15:56.920 --> 15:58.910
I only know how to press forward
against the odds,

15:58.928 --> 16:00.048
not how to back down.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.720
I want to set off firecrackers!

16:14.840 --> 16:15.790
Firecrackers!

16:15.790 --> 16:16.720
Set off firecrackers!

16:16.720 --> 16:17.390
Come here, quick.

16:17.510 --> 16:18.390
Firecrackers!

16:33.168 --> 16:34.390
Chinese New Year is the best.

16:34.390 --> 16:35.360
- It is.
- It is.

16:36.150 --> 16:37.030
Be careful.

16:37.030 --> 16:39.120
Go on, set off more.

16:52.200 --> 16:54.360
This decorative knot is quite unique.

16:54.576 --> 16:56.064
I happen to be in need of one.

16:56.390 --> 16:58.360
I wonder if you would gift it to me.

16:59.550 --> 17:01.320
I made this knot for my father.

17:03.150 --> 17:04.270
Then, could you

17:04.720 --> 17:06.270
make another one for me?

17:08.310 --> 17:09.000
I'm sorry.

17:09.510 --> 17:10.680
I don't have the free time.

17:12.510 --> 17:13.550
Xihe,

17:13.550 --> 17:14.880
the Crown Prince likes it.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.110
Just give it to him.

17:19.880 --> 17:21.590
Seeing your family reunited

17:22.480 --> 17:23.640
makes me quite envious.

17:25.590 --> 17:27.270
Although I have many siblings,

17:27.776 --> 17:29.890
on Chinese New Year's Eve
and Chinese New Year's Day,

17:30.310 --> 17:31.680
there's no one to keep me company.

17:32.550 --> 17:33.550
And not a single person

17:34.080 --> 17:35.888
gave me a Chinese New Year's gift.

17:41.310 --> 17:42.440
So just give it to me.

17:43.936 --> 17:46.048
I'm going to hang the spring paintings.

17:50.640 --> 17:51.350
I'll go with you.

17:59.070 --> 17:59.920
It's beautiful.

18:07.860 --> 18:10.380
(Noble Sentiment and Lofty Disposition)

18:11.530 --> 18:13.770
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

18:15.100 --> 18:17.350
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

18:20.500 --> 18:23.580
(Tao Residence)

18:25.880 --> 18:28.820
♪I've hidden so many words♪

18:29.440 --> 18:32.240
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

18:33.110 --> 18:40.080
♪So never uncover♪

18:40.270 --> 18:42.630
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

18:44.200 --> 18:46.030
Mother, look! It's so pretty!

18:47.200 --> 18:48.270
So pretty.

18:49.790 --> 18:51.110
It's beautiful.

18:51.750 --> 18:53.110
The more

18:54.000 --> 18:55.980
I look at your knot,
the more exquisite it seems.

18:58.170 --> 19:01.020
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

19:03.270 --> 19:04.680
I don't know when the day will come

19:06.160 --> 19:07.590
that someone will think of me,

19:09.160 --> 19:10.310
and during the holidays,

19:10.880 --> 19:13.160
prepare a handmade gift for me.

19:15.400 --> 19:16.750
And that someone

19:17.830 --> 19:19.440
will wish me blessings and a long life.

19:19.730 --> 19:25.850
♪So brave as if not afraid
of disappointment♪

19:26.890 --> 19:30.190
♪You understand my pride♪

19:30.480 --> 19:33.500
♪It is actually just like yours♪

19:34.400 --> 19:35.310
Are you satisfied now?

19:40.210 --> 19:44.130
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

19:44.160 --> 19:45.296
An inch of concentric thread,

19:45.632 --> 19:47.070
a flower for a hundred years of life.

19:47.504 --> 19:49.184
There's a saying
in the imperial capital.

19:49.510 --> 19:51.000
If, at the turn of the new year,

19:51.072 --> 19:53.420
one can stay up with their beloved
to see the new year in,

19:53.440 --> 19:55.310
they will live in harmony
for a hundred years,

19:55.400 --> 19:56.624
and be forever united in heart.

19:59.130 --> 20:04.950
♪The flustered mortal world♪

20:06.290 --> 20:12.310
♪Your eyes remain clear and bright♪

20:47.776 --> 20:49.872
Just see me out from here,
Your Highness.

20:52.496 --> 20:54.000
Let me escort you back to your manor.

20:54.070 --> 20:54.976
That's not necessary.

20:55.160 --> 20:56.830
Today is a day for family reunions.

20:57.088 --> 20:58.830
You should also return
to the palace early

20:58.960 --> 21:01.640
to celebrate the festival with
His Majesty and the Empress Dowager.

21:26.480 --> 21:27.110
Your Highness,

21:27.328 --> 21:28.920
Prince Xin is waiting for you up ahead.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.816
Forgive my impertinence, Your Highness.

21:33.056 --> 21:34.350
Where are you going?

21:34.350 --> 21:35.200
Come back here!

21:35.750 --> 21:36.510
Stop shouting.

21:36.750 --> 21:37.880
He's been bribed.

21:37.952 --> 21:39.552
How could he possibly come back?

21:40.160 --> 21:41.830
Your Highness,
let me drive the carriage.

21:43.310 --> 21:43.880
Wait.

21:45.790 --> 21:46.920
If I don't see him,

21:47.790 --> 21:49.160
he probably won't let this go.

21:50.000 --> 21:51.830
Who knows how many more
drivers he'll send?

22:07.200 --> 22:09.296
I have been waiting for you
for a long time.

22:09.550 --> 22:11.550
You've gone to so much trouble.

22:11.790 --> 22:12.830
What is this all for?

22:13.728 --> 22:15.344
Tonight is Chinese New Year's Eve.

22:15.790 --> 22:16.830
There's something

22:19.160 --> 22:20.640
I'd like to watch with you.

22:41.750 --> 22:43.310
Your fireworks

22:43.720 --> 22:45.030
are certainly creative.

22:52.624 --> 22:53.920
On Chinese New Year's Eve,

22:55.600 --> 22:57.792
a husband and wife stay up
to welcome the new year.

22:58.750 --> 22:59.590
It symbolizes

23:01.880 --> 23:03.200
growing old together

23:04.400 --> 23:05.750
year after year.

23:06.896 --> 23:08.608
But in the five years
we had been married,

23:11.440 --> 23:13.680
Qingzhi had never stayed up
with me for the new year.

23:15.920 --> 23:18.790
Every year, I was in the palace with
my father and the Empress Dowager.

23:19.400 --> 23:20.480
After the family banquet,

23:22.200 --> 23:23.440
when I returned to my manor,

23:27.110 --> 23:28.790
she went straight to her room to rest.

23:32.270 --> 23:33.920
She's always so

23:36.480 --> 23:37.680
cold and distant.

23:38.120 --> 23:40.940
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

23:40.940 --> 23:43.490
♪The story is sketched anew♪

23:44.920 --> 23:45.640
Qingzhi.

23:48.480 --> 23:49.750
Happy Chinese New Year.

23:51.270 --> 23:54.000
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

23:54.000 --> 23:58.480
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

23:59.120 --> 24:01.760
♪I step onto this winding path♪

24:01.760 --> 24:04.100
♪What was swept away?♪

24:04.290 --> 24:08.460
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

24:09.500 --> 24:12.070
♪The clouds twist into a vortex♪

24:12.070 --> 24:14.820
♪Reaching out to touch you♪

24:14.820 --> 24:19.600
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

24:20.970 --> 24:23.240
♪Scene after scene of yesterday♪

24:23.240 --> 24:26.110
♪Lies between the sky and the water♪

24:26.110 --> 24:28.480
♪The stars are sinking♪

24:28.480 --> 24:31.480
♪Like a sunken vow♪

24:31.970 --> 24:34.650
♪You drifted away alone♪

24:36.350 --> 24:37.550
Back then,

24:39.790 --> 24:41.960
I still had the ambition
to rule the world.

24:43.750 --> 24:45.030
I wanted to make my wife

24:47.200 --> 24:49.350
the most honored woman in the world.

24:50.790 --> 24:51.830
I even

24:53.790 --> 24:55.240
deluded myself into thinking

24:56.750 --> 24:58.440
that once I ascended the throne,

25:02.000 --> 25:03.550
I would do everything in my power

25:05.160 --> 25:06.550
to make it up to Qingzhi.

25:17.480 --> 25:18.720
After you appeared,

25:20.550 --> 25:21.960
I sometimes find myself lost.

25:23.440 --> 25:25.400
Was my past with Qingzhi

25:25.920 --> 25:26.960
a dream,

25:29.070 --> 25:30.590
or is all of this before me

25:33.590 --> 25:34.720
a dream?

25:37.440 --> 25:38.200
Perhaps

25:40.110 --> 25:41.590
this is fate's way

25:43.350 --> 25:44.640
of showing us favor.

25:47.480 --> 25:48.590
It has let us

25:50.830 --> 25:52.400
return to the path where we began.

25:52.860 --> 25:55.450
♪A hand I cannot touch♪

25:55.450 --> 26:00.740
♪I hold it for a moment
in the reflection♪

26:01.960 --> 26:03.070
The fireworks are over.

26:04.200 --> 26:04.720
A dream

26:06.160 --> 26:07.400
is fleeting, after all.

26:15.360 --> 26:16.928
The night is late and the wind is cold.

26:18.480 --> 26:19.510
I must take my leave.

26:35.070 --> 26:36.440
I will have the fireworks

26:38.160 --> 26:39.920
light up the sky all night.

26:49.480 --> 26:50.310
Qingqing.

26:52.270 --> 26:53.400
Happy Chinese New Year.

27:25.980 --> 27:29.060
(Favorable Weather
and Abundant Harvests)

27:36.720 --> 27:38.400
Faced with a Crown Prince like him,

27:39.510 --> 27:41.960
what are your chances of winning?

27:52.980 --> 27:55.780
(Favorable Weather
and Abundant Harvests)

27:55.790 --> 27:56.350
Your Highness,

27:56.480 --> 27:59.104
Commandery Princess watched
the fireworks with the Fifth Prince.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.350
Aren't you jealous?

28:01.160 --> 28:02.240
Why would I be jealous?

28:03.350 --> 28:04.550
I should thank Changqing.

28:05.200 --> 28:06.030
Thank him?

28:06.510 --> 28:07.680
When a person's good qualities

28:08.160 --> 28:09.350
contrast with others,

28:09.720 --> 28:11.030
it would seem even better.

28:11.744 --> 28:13.536
Green leaves
make a red flower stand out.

28:13.600 --> 28:15.376
The red flower
looks even more beautiful.

28:15.590 --> 28:16.310
Your Highness,

28:16.416 --> 28:17.750
when it comes to being cunning,

28:18.360 --> 28:19.890
you don't need anyone as a foil.

28:20.400 --> 28:22.240
You've already mastered the art.

28:27.740 --> 28:31.500
(Residence of the Heir
of the Marquis of Shunan)

28:39.568 --> 28:41.216
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

28:42.750 --> 28:43.790
Be careful with those!

28:43.790 --> 28:45.664
All are famous works
of calligraphy and painting.

28:46.750 --> 28:47.550
Cui Jinbai.

28:50.176 --> 28:52.430
Weren't you supposed
to be on official business in Bianzhou?

28:52.440 --> 28:54.590
Why are you moving into my residence?
Are you insane?

28:54.920 --> 28:56.200
I have no other choice.

28:56.350 --> 28:57.590
I must stay here for a while.

28:58.680 --> 28:59.400
What is it?

29:03.000 --> 29:04.640
What is it? Tell me.

29:05.536 --> 29:07.000
I lost my mother when I was young.

29:07.104 --> 29:09.248
My stepmother
was originally quite good to me.

29:09.360 --> 29:11.160
But ever since my younger brother
was born,

29:12.070 --> 29:12.880
everything changed.

29:13.880 --> 29:14.720
I get it.

29:15.350 --> 29:17.480
All that scheming and backstabbing
in the household.

29:17.600 --> 29:19.456
I wouldn't have minded
putting up with it.

29:19.480 --> 29:21.872
But recently, my younger brother
has been crying constantly.

29:21.936 --> 29:24.176
My stepmother invited a master
to our home for guidance.

29:24.240 --> 29:26.780
He said that my fate clashes
with my younger brother's this year.

29:26.790 --> 29:28.310
And that I needed to move out.

29:28.310 --> 29:29.960
But you're the Deputy Chief of Justice.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.960
You have countless ways to solve this.

29:32.590 --> 29:33.270
That's right.

29:34.030 --> 29:35.480
So I reported it to His Majesty

29:35.584 --> 29:37.350
and requested to stay
at the Bu Residence.

29:38.310 --> 29:39.550
If I didn't come,

29:39.632 --> 29:41.312
wouldn't that be deceiving the emperor?

29:42.032 --> 29:43.550
I'm going to go check on my luggage.

29:43.750 --> 29:46.030
Wait. Is that really
how "deceiving the emperor" works?

29:46.110 --> 29:46.640
By the way,

29:48.016 --> 29:49.880
I've instructed the kitchen
to prepare dinner.

29:50.192 --> 29:51.350
We'll dine together later

29:51.408 --> 29:52.820
to celebrate Chinese New Year's Eve.

30:07.830 --> 30:08.590
Your Highness.

30:08.800 --> 30:10.400
At the very beginning of the new year,

30:10.448 --> 30:11.600
Prince Munuha of the Le clan

30:11.610 --> 30:13.210
came to the capital to present tribute.

30:13.270 --> 30:15.648
And he formally proposed
a marriage alliance to His Majesty.

30:15.648 --> 30:16.550
A marriage alliance?

30:17.344 --> 30:19.440
All the princesses are afraid
of being chosen.

30:19.720 --> 30:22.000
What noble lady would want
to marry so far away?

30:22.110 --> 30:23.696
The living conditions are inconvenient,

30:23.728 --> 30:25.160
there's no one to support you,

30:25.160 --> 30:27.200
and you might not even
understand the Le language.

30:27.400 --> 30:29.030
It's terrifying just thinking about it.

30:31.000 --> 30:32.224
Is this information reliable?

30:35.400 --> 30:36.030
I'm doomed.

30:36.720 --> 30:37.400
I'm doomed.

30:37.750 --> 30:39.030
What am I going to do?

30:39.440 --> 30:40.070
Your Highness,

30:40.128 --> 30:42.200
no decision has yet been reached
as to which princess

30:42.210 --> 30:44.060
should be sent to form
this marriage alliance.

30:44.070 --> 30:45.720
Among the unmarried princesses,

30:45.880 --> 30:46.920
I am the eldest.

30:47.312 --> 30:48.416
According to royal custom,

30:48.448 --> 30:50.560
the eldest is married off
before the younger ones.

30:50.590 --> 30:51.790
Besides me, the first choice,

30:51.790 --> 30:52.750
who else could it be?

30:53.160 --> 30:53.920
What if

30:54.510 --> 30:56.000
we go and beg the Empress Dowager?

30:56.080 --> 30:57.680
Out of respect for the Empress Dowager,

30:57.750 --> 30:58.960
perhaps His Majesty will...

30:58.976 --> 31:01.150
Last time, when we
were discussing the Spring Banquet,

31:01.168 --> 31:02.910
I just said a few things
about that Shen Xihe,

31:02.920 --> 31:03.952
and the Empress Dowager

31:04.030 --> 31:06.160
hasn't been as close to me
as she used to be.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.640
Besides, the three princesses

31:07.640 --> 31:09.000
are all her granddaughters.

31:09.040 --> 31:10.310
I'm afraid the Empress Dowager

31:10.480 --> 31:11.640
won't stand up for me.

31:12.160 --> 31:12.790
Well...

31:13.160 --> 31:13.880
Your Highness,

31:14.440 --> 31:15.790
then what should we do?

31:16.240 --> 31:17.200
I won't marry him!

31:17.984 --> 31:19.696
I refuse to be part
of a marriage alliance!

31:21.310 --> 31:22.550
I must find a way out

31:23.750 --> 31:25.240
for myself.

31:31.200 --> 31:33.952
Your Highness, you climbed the mountain
to offer the first incense.

31:33.968 --> 31:35.024
With such piety,

31:35.160 --> 31:36.720
the Buddha will surely bless you

31:36.790 --> 31:38.400
and keep that Munuha far away.

31:39.070 --> 31:40.400
I hope so.

31:46.260 --> 31:47.220
(Munuha, Prince of the Le Tribe)

31:47.240 --> 31:48.592
Your Highness, wait a moment.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.750
Prince Munuha,

31:50.912 --> 31:52.350
although you are an honored guest,

31:52.720 --> 31:53.920
do you know the consequences

31:54.350 --> 31:55.550
for blocking my path?

31:56.096 --> 31:57.568
Your Highness, please forgive me.

31:57.830 --> 31:59.270
I mean no offense.

31:59.648 --> 32:01.160
I came looking for you so abruptly,

32:01.160 --> 32:03.160
only because we share a common goal.

32:03.160 --> 32:04.576
What nonsense are you talking about?

32:04.640 --> 32:05.640
Between you and me,

32:05.936 --> 32:07.640
what common goal
could there possibly be?

32:07.640 --> 32:09.070
Don't be so quick to refuse.

32:09.104 --> 32:10.720
The wish you prayed to the gods for...

32:11.240 --> 32:12.880
How about I make it come true for you?

32:26.510 --> 32:27.400
What do you mean?

32:29.456 --> 32:31.350
I want the beloved daughter
of the Duke of Wei

32:32.160 --> 32:33.480
to become my woman.

32:33.830 --> 32:34.720
Are you insane?

32:34.880 --> 32:36.440
She is the future Crown Princess.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.240
Are you trying

32:38.750 --> 32:40.350
to start a war between our two nations?

32:41.360 --> 32:42.680
There are rumors in the palace.

32:42.688 --> 32:45.480
The marriage between Commandery
Princess Zhaoning and the Crown Prince

32:45.480 --> 32:46.608
is on the verge of collapse.

32:47.590 --> 32:48.510
And I

32:49.070 --> 32:51.070
am sincerely asking
for her hand in marriage.

32:52.880 --> 32:53.790
Sincerely?

32:54.790 --> 32:55.880
If you marry her,

32:56.000 --> 32:58.816
you'll have a chance to transfer
the Duke of Wei from the northwest.

32:59.120 --> 33:00.960
As long as the Shen father
and son are gone,

33:01.590 --> 33:02.510
the northwest

33:02.920 --> 33:04.480
will no longer be impregnable.

33:06.448 --> 33:08.670
Since you're concerned
about the country and its people,

33:08.680 --> 33:10.510
why not marry me soon
for the sake of Daxing?

33:10.880 --> 33:12.030
Don't be delusional!

33:12.320 --> 33:14.100
If you want to remain
in the imperial capital

33:14.112 --> 33:15.632
as the most distinguished noble lady,

33:15.830 --> 33:17.070
you must join forces with me.

33:18.110 --> 33:20.510
This is your only chance
to escape the marriage alliance.

33:21.952 --> 33:23.440
Your true aim is the northwest.

33:23.720 --> 33:25.070
Even I can see that.

33:25.440 --> 33:27.160
How could His Majesty not see it?

33:30.672 --> 33:32.720
This is a secret medicine
from my royal court,

33:32.720 --> 33:33.790
Enchanting Essence.

33:34.240 --> 33:35.440
Just one pill

33:35.440 --> 33:37.160
is enough to arouse even an immortal.

33:37.632 --> 33:39.440
After a man and woman
have been intimate,

33:39.640 --> 33:41.920
even the most skilled physician
won't find any

33:41.920 --> 33:43.030
trace of the drug.

33:43.400 --> 33:44.240
Despicable!

33:45.640 --> 33:46.510
In a few days,

33:46.592 --> 33:48.070
the palace will hold a banquet for me.

33:48.080 --> 33:50.260
Ladies from the imperial clan
and noble families will be there.

33:50.270 --> 33:52.384
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
will attend as well.

33:52.880 --> 33:55.270
Whether or not I can happily
marry the Commandery Princess

33:55.400 --> 33:58.510
all depends on you, Princess Pingling.

34:01.510 --> 34:03.472
If you are truly infatuated with me,

34:03.536 --> 34:05.390
and are willing to marry far from home,

34:05.750 --> 34:06.790
that's also an option.

34:33.550 --> 34:35.000
Will your plan work?

34:35.280 --> 34:38.064
Would she really dare to make a move
on Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

34:39.440 --> 34:40.670
You just wait

34:41.150 --> 34:42.760
for your rendezvous with the beauty.

34:49.700 --> 34:54.260
(Taiji Hall)

35:16.016 --> 35:18.176
I deserve to be punished.

35:19.070 --> 35:20.550
It's all right. Get up.

35:23.150 --> 35:24.400
Let me show you the way

35:24.550 --> 35:26.144
to the side hall to change your clothes.

35:27.000 --> 35:27.590
Let's go.

35:44.880 --> 35:45.710
Strange.

35:45.760 --> 35:47.110
Why does the route to the side hall

35:47.110 --> 35:48.320
have to be such a long detour?

35:58.800 --> 35:59.880
The person leading the way

35:59.880 --> 36:01.000
suddenly vanished.

36:10.400 --> 36:11.536
Your Highness, be careful!

36:12.510 --> 36:13.110
Mo Yu!

36:14.400 --> 36:15.000
Your Highness!

37:48.590 --> 37:49.480
After all these years,

37:49.480 --> 37:50.480
I finally have the chance

37:50.670 --> 37:52.150
to spar with you, Huayong.

37:55.070 --> 37:57.232
I cut his left shoulder.

37:57.264 --> 37:59.490
If you are willing
to remove your clothes to prove it,

37:59.504 --> 38:01.840
all suspicion against you
will vanish completely.

38:02.150 --> 38:03.070
Are you willing

38:03.440 --> 38:04.630
to leave with me?

38:04.630 --> 38:08.880
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

38:10.831 --> 38:13.771
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:14.391 --> 38:17.191
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:18.061 --> 38:25.031
♪So never uncover♪

38:25.221 --> 38:27.581
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:28.711 --> 38:31.441
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:32.401 --> 38:37.741
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

38:39.501 --> 38:42.321
♪Every answer I gave♪

38:43.121 --> 38:45.971
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

38:46.761 --> 38:50.131
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

38:50.391 --> 38:53.701
♪How hard it truly was?♪

38:56.671 --> 39:00.111
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

39:01.101 --> 39:03.431
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:04.701 --> 39:10.461
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:11.871 --> 39:15.001
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:15.451 --> 39:18.461
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:18.571 --> 39:25.211
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:25.211 --> 39:28.881
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:29.751 --> 39:32.511
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:32.951 --> 39:36.081
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:36.521 --> 39:42.471
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:43.871 --> 39:47.421
♪You'll never♪

39:47.701 --> 39:57.171
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

40:23.341 --> 40:26.821
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
